      "findings": "Added: Junip retailer review junip:13200181, actor 215817888, published 2026-05-10T02:01:45.837Z; Softwear–Void, formula/version unknown. Repeated lid unscrewing and pocket leakage at work stain underwear/shirt/jeans; lost product cannot be put back. Suggests click-lock or doe-foot; manufacturer attribution unverified. Loves product/favorite Void and explicitly will repurchase despite loss, cost concern, and annoyance; no completed repurchase. Rating 3, would_recommend=true, native verified_buyer=true, rewarded=false; engagement unavailable. Corroborates broader cap/leak concern under different use conditions, not arrival leakage or the unknown TikTok SKU; cross-venue identity overlap unresolved."
